-## Advanced Workflows
-
-### Pattern 12: Monorepo Support
-
-```bash
-# Project structure
-# monorepo/
-#   packages/
-#     package-a/
-#       pyproject.toml
-#     package-b/
-#       pyproject.toml
-#   pyproject.toml (root)
-
-# Root pyproject.toml
