-
-### From pip + requirements.txt
-
-```bash
-# Before
-python -m venv .venv
-source .venv/bin/activate
-pip install -r requirements.txt
-
-# After
-uv venv
-uv pip install -r requirements.txt
-# Or better:
-uv init
-uv add -r requirements.txt
-```
